# Old site URLs → new pages (Cloudflare Workers/Pages static assets).
# Trailing slashes (/fleet → /fleet/) are handled by Cloudflare automatically.
# Old-site routes without a page of their own also get an explicit trailing-slash variant.
/booking         /book/      301
/reservations    /book/      301
/privacy-policy  /privacy/   301
# The old /reviews page → the home page's reviews section (the old nav linked /#reviews too).
/reviews         /#reviews   301
/reviews/        /#reviews   301
